const x=40,y=34,w=touchHud?360:315;
ctx.font = `${touchHud?15:10}px ${SANS}`;
...
// estus
const fx=50, fy = touchHud ? 130 : VH-50;
ctx.font = `${touchHud?15:10}px`;
label at fy-36...
bottle sizes could remain 23 spacing; on mobile scale .476, bottles become ~6px wide. Maybe increase spacing to 30 for touch and body bigger? If we scale bottle drawing, more code. Simpler: fx=50, i*30, bottles remain 14 tall. On mobile 7px. Could bump global scale by using ctx.save(); ctx.translate(fx,fy); ctx.scale(1.4,1.4) for entire estus group. But text position etc. More code. Not essential.
...
// souls
const sx = VW - 42;
const syLabel = touchHud ? 112 : VH-57;
const syNum = touchHud ? 145 : VH-27;
const gy = syNum - 8;
...
// boss bar
const bw = touchHud ? 420 : 600;
const by = touchHud ? VH - 230 : VH - 57;
...
// pause hint only if !touchHud
```
But souls label/number placement uses VH in glyph; update.

Let's patch carefully.

